id=questptcolor
name=Quest 1 Passthrough Colorizer
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=Juspertinry
description=Tints the greyscale passthrough view. The tint is applied inside mrservice's own passthrough sampler (samplePassthroughTextures), so it covers system passthrough and any app using the passthrough API without touching UI, 3D content or video. Colour is configurable via tint.conf or the ptcolor command.
